WEBVTT

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:37.328
<i>I'm currently studying management.</i>

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:41.291
<i>You've been able to do so</i>
<i>well in the same circumstances</i>

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:46.755
<i>that I thought I could do something, too. I...</i>

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.074
Huh?

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:17.911
Why are you crying?

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:26.294
I don't really know.
My heart suddenly felt so full...

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:33.593
<i>Saya? It can't be!</i>

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.388
<i>Is that what this is?</i>

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.765
I'm sorry.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:42.310
I'm Shinora Aleisra. And you are?

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:45.730
Leerin. Leerin Marfes.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:50.151
It looks like we can be good friends, huh?

00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:58.702
--Not too big, not too small,
--Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...

00:01:58.702 --> 00:02:00.036
--but fits in the palm of your hand
--What are you doing?!

00:02:00.036 --> 00:02:02.747
--with just a little left over. This, yes, <i>this</i>!
--Please stop that!

00:02:02.747 --> 00:02:04.791
-- This is what I've been looking for!
--I'm telling you, no!

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.959
You mustn't...

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.752
Lee-<i>chan</i>, you're the greatest.

00:02:07.752 --> 00:02:10.922
This won't do! Shinora--!

00:02:13.925 --> 00:02:17.053
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:17.053 --> 00:02:20.598
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:02:20.598 --> 00:02:28.314
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:33.778
<i>Chizu o ushinatte samayotteiru machi</i>

00:02:33.778 --> 00:02:37.240
<i>Owariyuku sekai demo</i>

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:43.955
<i>Karada no oku de hashiru</i>
<i>no o yamenai inochi o kikasete</i>

00:02:43.955 --> 00:02:47.250
<i>Tayasanai hikari o tozasanai hitomi ni</i>

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.628
<i>Kawaitemo yakitsuketa</i>

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:57.218
<i>Kizutsuku koto mo naku te ni</i>
<i>suru mono nante nanimo shinjinai</i>

00:02:57.218 --> 00:03:03.141
<i>Dareka ni mukatta hitosuji no omoi wa</i>

00:03:03.141 --> 00:03:11.024
<i>Yoake no you ni hagane no yami o kirisaku</i>

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:15.362
<i>Itsuka brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:03:15.362 --> 00:03:19.032
<i>Dakara tsuyoku kaeru</i>

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:24.996
<i>Kasaneta chikara mo inori mo</i>

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:28.667
<i>Kousa suru mirai, kakaeta negai</i>

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:32.087
<i>Dare no te ni mo watasenai</i>

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:33.630
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:39.636
<i>Kokoro o tsuraneru</i>

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.894
Hiya! Thank you, little kittens.

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:52.399
This is due to the competition.
There are twice as many fans as usual.

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:56.695
Dude, aren't you being unfriendly?
It wouldn't kill ya to at least wave.

00:03:56.695 --> 00:03:57.821
Senior Sharnid!

00:03:57.821 --> 00:03:59.447
Hey there, thanks!

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:02.450
Um...

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:33.815
A shower before a date sure is
great, huh? Especially a first date.

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:36.860
Huh? Felli-<i>chan</i>, you
trying to say you don't sweat?

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.070
This seems a place one could be spied upon.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:43.283
I'd say there's no chance of
that till you grow out a little more.

00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:47.746
Sorry. Oh, how'd your dite perform?

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:49.664
Without problem.

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:51.249
About your dite adjustments...

00:04:51.249 --> 00:04:53.960
If any of you feel
something's off, just tell me.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.754
Yeah, nothin' on my end.

00:04:55.754 --> 00:04:57.380
If there is, I'll say so.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.383
I swear, you guys are no fun.

00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:02.135
By the way, where's Layfon?

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:08.183
"Electronic Spirit Zuellni"

00:05:11.019 --> 00:05:14.272
You fought splendidly at the competition.

00:05:14.272 --> 00:05:16.649
To be expected from a
Keeper of the Heaven's Blade.

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:18.651
In Glendan, the Spear-Shelled City,

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:23.573
it is a title of honor given to
the twelve most gifted military artists.

00:05:23.573 --> 00:05:29.329
Also, they seem to own a certain
thing inconceivable to outsiders...

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:34.000
What's your point? I don't
have the Heaven's Blade anymore.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.835
If there's nothing else, I'll be leaving.

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:39.589
Incidentally, it seems you're still
working at the machinery department.

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:42.175
Was having your tuition
waived not good enough?

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:44.678
I don't want to be in your debt.

00:05:44.678 --> 00:05:48.348
I've heard that Layfon Alseif,
the Heaven's Blader that I know,

00:05:48.348 --> 00:05:53.978
is not a stickler for honor,
merely a man in need of money.

00:05:53.978 --> 00:05:59.567
I don't know how you got that
information, but it's incomplete.

00:05:59.567 --> 00:06:06.157
Well then, what manner of person
is Layfon Alseif? Would you explain?

00:06:06.157 --> 00:06:09.369
I'll pass. That's not for the likes of <i>you</i>.

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:13.456
Please don't be so naïve as to
think you can give less than your best.

00:06:13.456 --> 00:06:17.836
For this city's survival,
I will use whatever can be used!

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:22.257
Even your sister?

00:06:22.257 --> 00:06:25.427
Yes. Even my sister.

00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.524
Ma'am!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.539
Uh, do you want to trade lunches again today?

00:06:56.541 --> 00:07:01.546
Your test to enter the platoon...
You lost on purpose, didn't you?

00:07:02.964 --> 00:07:09.971
Your powers are incredible. Anyone
who'd seen the competition would know.

00:07:13.308 --> 00:07:15.393
I was born in Glendan,

00:07:15.393 --> 00:07:20.398
which moves on its own,
as if to be near the contaminoids.

00:07:20.398 --> 00:07:24.069
So I grew up in a world
where for us military artists,

00:07:24.069 --> 00:07:27.489
it was normal to fight
contaminoids on a regular basis.

00:07:27.489 --> 00:07:33.328
I've never felt fear during a battle.

00:07:33.328 --> 00:07:38.917
Because victory is assumed.
Otherwise, there's only death.

00:07:38.917 --> 00:07:41.878
That's the kind of world I grew up in.

00:07:41.878 --> 00:07:47.634
The military arts used to
be everything to me, too.

00:07:47.634 --> 00:07:52.055
But now, I think I'd like to
try searching for a new path.

00:07:52.055 --> 00:07:53.682
Why?

00:07:53.848 --> 00:07:55.850
The military arts aren't for me.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.355
Because I've already failed.

00:08:07.862 --> 00:08:09.864
Zuellni stopped?

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:14.953
Zuellni!

00:08:14.953 --> 00:08:15.912
Zuellni?

00:08:15.912 --> 00:08:19.332
The city's very
consciousness. An electronic spirit!

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:22.585
<i>What is it, Zuellni? Did something happen?</i>

00:08:23.795 --> 00:08:25.797
What are you all...

00:08:26.548 --> 00:08:27.549
Zuellni!

00:08:27.757 --> 00:08:29.342
Let Zuellni go!

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:31.970
Wait! Don't go near them!

00:08:32.137 --> 00:08:34.514
What are you doing here, worm?

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:37.976
I have ties to this city. Didn't you know?

00:08:38.727 --> 00:08:40.020
Ma'am!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.730
What is it?

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.606
Can't be helped...

00:08:47.777 --> 00:08:49.404
Ma'am!

00:08:50.405 --> 00:08:52.032
Ma'am?

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:57.370
--Zuellni!
--Don't interfere.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.748
You're a spirit thief as well?

00:08:59.748 --> 00:09:03.668
Wolfmask Mob, 3rd Platoon... Advance!

00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:05.295
Restoration!

00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:14.596
Little fishies, you can go
squirming around in Ignacius's flask!

00:09:18.183 --> 00:09:21.811
Don't! These enemies are
more than you can handle!

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:25.065
That's one young lady who refuses to listen.

00:09:25.065 --> 00:09:28.651
"Seek, and do so with all one's strength!"

00:09:28.651 --> 00:09:32.655
By the way, you guys won't be
able to get a Connection from Zuellni.

00:09:32.655 --> 00:09:34.991
Your information is wrong!

00:09:34.991 --> 00:09:36.826
"Connection"?

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.204
Zuellni!

00:09:46.127 --> 00:09:47.754
Don't look!

00:09:49.464 --> 00:09:52.801
You looked... You looked...

00:09:52.801 --> 00:09:54.219
Shit!

00:09:54.219 --> 00:09:57.097
Augmenting-Ballistic Kei,
Melding Transformation...

00:09:57.097 --> 00:09:59.307
Swift Lightning!

00:10:10.485 --> 00:10:12.112
Zuellni!

00:10:15.865 --> 00:10:18.243
I apologize for getting you mixed up in this.

00:10:18.243 --> 00:10:19.119
Just who are y--

00:10:19.119 --> 00:10:21.538
No hard feelings, okay?

00:10:23.832 --> 00:10:26.584
My name is Dickserio Muscaine.

00:10:26.584 --> 00:10:31.798
But when you wake up,
no doubt you'll have forgotten all this.

00:10:34.426 --> 00:10:36.052
Ma'am!

00:10:36.845 --> 00:10:38.471
Ma'am!

00:10:41.933 --> 00:10:44.561
This is an electronic spirit?

00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:43.453
Put that back!
That electronic spirit was just born!

00:11:43.453 --> 00:11:47.582
Let go! If I sell this,
I can get a ton of money.

00:11:47.582 --> 00:11:50.418
--Schneivalle is the only city with a copy system
--I won't let you do this!

00:11:50.418 --> 00:11:52.754
that can create them!

00:11:54.798 --> 00:11:58.927
The electronic fairies are
this city's important friends!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.887
Shut up!

00:12:07.769 --> 00:12:09.396
Shit!

00:12:25.662 --> 00:12:27.664
You stupid brat!

00:12:46.891 --> 00:12:49.519
I wonder if I'll die...

00:13:01.531 --> 00:13:03.158
You're...

00:13:04.826 --> 00:13:08.830
Oh. So you're all right.

00:13:18.631 --> 00:13:21.843
<i>Is that Schneivalle?</i>

00:13:23.053 --> 00:13:28.933
<i>Oh. So that's why the city's legs have stopped.</i>

00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:34.397
<i>I'm glad... that what I did wasn't a mistake.</i>

00:13:47.494 --> 00:13:50.121
What are you do--

00:13:57.587 --> 00:14:01.174
No... You can't...

00:14:01.174 --> 00:14:06.805
You mustn't do that! You mustn't!

00:14:15.063 --> 00:14:20.235
That electronic fairy
gave its own life to help Nina.

00:14:20.235 --> 00:14:25.448
Maybe that's when Nina
started thinking weakness is a sin.

00:14:25.448 --> 00:14:30.370
Unable to protect who you want
to, losing who you want to help...

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.665
She doesn't want to experience that ever again.

00:14:34.416 --> 00:14:38.628
That's why Nina's desire to become strong

00:14:38.628 --> 00:14:41.840
is fiercer and purer than anyone's.

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:46.261
I'm her childhood friend.
I know what Nina feels.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.098
I'll go get some water.

00:15:05.321 --> 00:15:07.365
Thank you for coming. It was a big help.

00:15:07.365 --> 00:15:11.161
No, I was glad you got in touch with me.

00:15:11.161 --> 00:15:12.787
See you.

00:15:16.916 --> 00:15:18.918
I found Lay-ton! I found Lay-ton!

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:20.545
"Lay-ton"?

00:15:21.671 --> 00:15:23.048
A successful capture!

00:15:23.048 --> 00:15:25.216
Roger. Mission complete!

00:15:25.216 --> 00:15:27.594
You remember meeting us
at the entrance ceremony, right?

00:15:27.594 --> 00:15:30.430
I'm Mifi, this is Naruki and...

00:15:31.765 --> 00:15:32.599
What?

00:15:32.599 --> 00:15:37.604
C'mon, May-cchi! There's
something you want to say, right?

00:15:40.023 --> 00:15:43.943
Thank you very much for helping
me that time at the entrance ceremony!

00:15:43.943 --> 00:15:46.821
Uh, that was no big deal.

00:15:46.821 --> 00:15:52.243
It <i>was </i>a big deal! I wrote an
article all about your exploits, and look!

00:15:52.243 --> 00:15:54.162
I totally got it sold!

00:15:54.162 --> 00:15:57.040
Anyhow, from your
actions at the entrance ceremony

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.877
to transferring to the Military Arts
Department, being chosen for a platoon

00:16:00.877 --> 00:16:03.505
and then giving a performance
like that at your first competition...

00:16:03.505 --> 00:16:05.965
You may not look it, but
your actions are quite flamboyant.

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:08.927
Uh... Anyway, what was with that rope?

00:16:08.927 --> 00:16:12.055
Oh, Nakki wants to join the municipal police!

00:16:12.055 --> 00:16:15.600
That's why I practice rope-binding
techniques like this almost every day.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:19.896
May-cchi wants to work in a cake
shop, so she makes sweets every day.

00:16:19.896 --> 00:16:22.148
Um um um...

00:16:22.148 --> 00:16:23.149
This...

00:16:23.566 --> 00:16:25.235
Oh, Senior Felli.

00:16:25.235 --> 00:16:26.903
That's someone from the 17th Platoon!

00:16:26.903 --> 00:16:28.780
Nakki, capture her at once!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.949
Roger!

00:16:30.949 --> 00:16:32.283
A successful capture!

00:16:32.283 --> 00:16:33.993
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:16:33.993 --> 00:16:36.246
I'm Mifi Rotten from the Weekly Look'N.

00:16:36.246 --> 00:16:38.832
So, this bigshot new platoon member,
the guy who descended like a comet...

00:16:38.832 --> 00:16:43.086
Layton Alseif! I'd love to interview
him and everyone in the 17th Platoon.

00:16:43.086 --> 00:16:43.670
--What?

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:44.879
--Like I said, an interview!
--What?

00:16:44.879 --> 00:16:46.172
--What?
--What?

00:16:46.172 --> 00:16:49.509
I don't think they're bad people...

00:16:49.509 --> 00:16:54.014
I am not concerned.
The rope and so forth was somewhat fun.

00:16:54.014 --> 00:16:55.598
It was fun?!

00:16:55.598 --> 00:16:58.852
But I am disappointed in you.

00:16:58.852 --> 00:17:01.730
Your actions are contradictory.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:05.358
I know. I don't think I
should stay this way either.

00:17:06.943 --> 00:17:08.945
Then I forgive you.

00:17:09.404 --> 00:17:14.325
But in return, from now
on I will call you Fon-Fon.

00:17:14.325 --> 00:17:17.120
Fon-Fon? But, ma'am!

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:21.708
I do not like being called
a general term like "ma'am," either.

00:17:21.708 --> 00:17:24.544
I require a different term of address.

00:17:24.544 --> 00:17:30.675
Let's see... Very well, please call me Felli.

00:17:30.675 --> 00:17:32.761
And you shall be Fon-Fon.

00:17:32.761 --> 00:17:33.762
But that's--

00:17:33.762 --> 00:17:37.223
Were you or were you not
called "Lay-ton" by those girls?

00:17:37.223 --> 00:17:39.893
That wasn't my idea!

00:17:39.893 --> 00:17:44.314
If you do not care for Fon-Fon,
I will think of a different name.

00:17:44.314 --> 00:17:50.320
Lay. Lay-chin. Lay-<i>kun</i>.
Lay-<i>chan</i>. Lay-cchi. Which do you prefer?

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.113
Uh, they're all sort of...

00:17:52.113 --> 00:17:54.991
Fine, then shall we use "Lay of the Land"?

00:17:54.991 --> 00:17:59.204
"Good morning, Lay of the Land."
"Good afternoon, Lay of the Land."

00:17:59.204 --> 00:18:03.333
"Good night, Lay of the Land."
That's embarrassing, isn't it?

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.753
If you know that, then don't say it!

00:18:10.215 --> 00:18:12.842
Fine. "Fon-Fon" it is.

00:18:24.312 --> 00:18:26.690
Madam Alshera! Majesty!

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:28.191
It's out of the question!

00:18:28.191 --> 00:18:30.944
But with Layfon Alseif now gone,

00:18:30.944 --> 00:18:35.865
custom says the twelfth Heaven's
Blade be decided in competition.

00:18:35.865 --> 00:18:38.451
Fool, do you know the
meaning of the Heaven's Blades?

00:18:38.451 --> 00:18:41.913
A Keeper of the Heaven's Blade
chosen merely by rote can eat shit!

00:18:41.913 --> 00:18:43.164
Shit?

00:18:43.164 --> 00:18:47.377
Don't ever mention that
pathetic "competition" again!

00:18:49.421 --> 00:18:53.967
You've gotten quite
good at being queen, Kanalis.

00:18:53.967 --> 00:18:55.260
Your Majesty!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:58.847
Still, I should be more beautiful than this.

00:18:58.847 --> 00:19:01.057
How the people around you
haven't noticed is a mystery.

00:19:01.057 --> 00:19:05.687
Even with surgery, one such as
I would pale to Her Majesty's beauty!

00:19:05.687 --> 00:19:08.356
Think not of me! Though I may
be harassed, I may be tormented,

00:19:08.356 --> 00:19:11.192
if Her Majesty has decided to
return to the palace, I shall gladly...

00:19:12.777 --> 00:19:14.988
It <i>miiight </i>be a little longer.

00:19:14.988 --> 00:19:17.490
Don't say things like
"<i>miiight</i>" trying to act cute!

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:22.245
And stop using kei to make
yourself younger and lie about how old you...

00:19:25.206 --> 00:19:28.376
Just who do you think you're talking to, huh?!

00:19:28.793 --> 00:19:29.753
I'm gonna die...

00:19:29.753 --> 00:19:32.797
No matter how skilled a
Heaven's Blade Keeper you may be,

00:19:32.797 --> 00:19:35.216
the power of a queen is far, far greater.

00:19:35.508 --> 00:19:38.678
But you said you'd already had
your fill of the life of a normal woman,

00:19:38.678 --> 00:19:42.307
you were just about sick of it,
it's quitting time! That's what you said!

00:19:42.307 --> 00:19:48.730
Why, why, <i>why</i>?! Come back!
The other Heaven's Blades won't obey me!

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:55.362
Don't cry. I've encountered
someone I must protect.

00:19:55.862 --> 00:20:00.575
So I can't stop being Shinora Aleisra right now.

00:20:00.575 --> 00:20:02.577
Thanks very much.

00:20:10.669 --> 00:20:17.300
That may well be the moment
"Shinora Aleisra" became real.

00:21:07.308 --> 00:21:08.643
Saya!

00:21:08.643 --> 00:21:11.646
We gotta get out of here, now!

00:21:14.858 --> 00:21:17.569
Stop or I'll shoot!

00:21:29.164 --> 00:21:32.167
I could see the bullets?

00:21:38.965 --> 00:21:41.593
My right eye and my left arm.

00:21:41.593 --> 00:21:44.095
Use them.

00:21:44.095 --> 00:21:46.723
Are these yours?

00:21:46.723 --> 00:21:49.351
Where were you keeping it?

00:21:50.769 --> 00:21:55.607
Since I decided to
accompany you, everything is yours.

00:21:57.192 --> 00:21:59.944
Then I'll protect you.

00:21:59.944 --> 00:22:04.949
Let's get out of here safely, and we
can figure out how to survive in this world.

00:22:06.326 --> 00:22:10.622
This is the deal between you and me.

00:22:10.622 --> 00:22:11.706
--There they are!
--Freeze!

00:22:11.706 --> 00:22:13.333
Don't move!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.960
