00:23:18.064 --> 00:23:23.737
<i>Samete yuku yo ni koi o shite</i>

00:23:23.737 --> 00:23:29.284
<i>Yume no naka made tsurete itte</i>

00:23:29.284 --> 00:23:34.956
<i>Itsudatte kimi wa, itsudatte kimi wa</i>

00:23:34.956 --> 00:23:43.715
<i>Itsudatte boku ni yasashii uso tsuita</i>

00:23:53.933 --> 00:23:57.854
<i>Felli Loss, the nen'i</i>
<i>operator who hates her own abilities.</i>

00:23:57.854 --> 00:24:00.690
<i>To discover the new possibilities of the future,</i>

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:02.901
